# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Phase 11 / Task 1 — credential files the generic rules above MISS.
#
# `.env` and `.env.*` do NOT match `deploy.env`. `scripts/deploy.env` therefore
# sat in the tree UNIGNORED while holding a real Supabase service_role key
# (219 chars) and JWT secret (88 chars) — one `git add -A` from being committed.
# Now excluded by pattern, so a future `scripts/staging.env` cannot slip in
# either. `.env.example` (placeholders only) stays tracked deliberately.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
scripts/deploy.env
scripts/*.env
*.env
!.env.example

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Phase 12 / P1-9 — CJK fonts are PROVISIONED, not source.
#
# `scripts/setup-pdf-font.mjs` fetches Noto Sans SC (~17 MB, OFL) so Chinese
# PDFs render instead of degrading, and `scripts/setup-cjk-font.mjs` copies a
# system CJK font. The Dockerfile runs the fetch at build time, so the image
# carries the font while the repository does not accumulate a 17 MB binary in
# its history forever. public/fonts/README.md documents the discovery order and
# stays tracked.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
public/fonts/*.ttf
public/fonts/*.otf
public/fonts/*.ttc
public/fonts/*.part
